Stud's changes to gfxstream for OpenGL mode (EGL-on-EGL), against
https://github.com/google/gfxstream.git at 0ab696da6e393009c2ebeeac8f33d1c9531d940f.
Apply with: git -C <gfxstream> apply <this file>
The guest build (guest/CMakeLists.txt) also takes Mesa's guest ring stream,
unchanged, from https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa.git at
daa925c3bc78697cc214317ee330a39d1acda19f.

